From: slothfulchat <patches@slothfulchat.invalid>
Date: Tue, 28 Jul 2026 12:40:19 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] web-app: emoji-set picker in Settings -> Appearance

Adds an "Emoji style" picker below the wallpaper options in Settings ->
Appearance (browser edition only), reading window.__slothfulchatEmoji (the hook
the web-app runtime exposes) and previewing each set in its own font. Also
makes the emoji-mart composer picker follow the selected set: emoji-mart
hardcodes the native-emoji font-family inline inside its shadow DOM, so the
existing shadow-style injection is extended to override it with
var(--emojifonts). Electron never sets the runtime global, so the selector
renders nothing there.
---
 .../src/components/EmojiPicker/index.tsx      |   9 +-
 .../src/components/Settings/Appearance.tsx    |   2 +
 .../components/Settings/EmojiSetSelector.tsx  | 116 ++++++++++++++++++
 3 files changed, 126 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)
 create mode 100644 packages/frontend/src/components/Settings/EmojiSetSelector.tsx

